WEBVTT

00:02:56.756 --> 00:03:01.260
Shuning uchun 10ning ko’paytuvchilari -
5 va 2 ham javob bo’lishi mumkin.

00:03:01.677 --> 00:03:04.138
Bir necha marta aylanganingizda,

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:07.016
lekin bu faqat boshlang’ich tartib
bo’lishi mumkin edi.

00:03:07.016 --> 00:03:10.269
Shunda yo’lda shamlarni adashtirib qo’ygan
bo’lsangizchi?

00:03:10.269 --> 00:03:14.315
Agar siz 1-shamdan 11-shamgacha hammasini
aylanish davomida yoqqan bo’lsangiz,

00:03:14.315 --> 00:03:16.943
uni o’chiring, keyin orqaga qayting,

00:03:17.151 --> 00:03:21.906
birinchi o’chirilgan sham sizga shamning
aniq sonini aytib beradi.

00:03:22.031 --> 00:03:24.784
Va agar siz o’chirilgan
shamni uchratmasangiz,

00:03:24.951 --> 00:03:27.995
siz shamlar soni 10tadan ko’pligini
bilib olasiz.

00:03:28.287 --> 00:03:31.749
Shunda kattaroq sonni taxmin qilib,
qaytadan urinib ko’ra olasiz.